sequenceDiagram
  participant UI
  participant API as JobOS API
  participant S as TF Search
  participant A as ATS API
  participant F as TF Fetch
  participant G as TF Agent
  participant L as Gemini
  UI->>API: hunt(role, location)
  API->>S: 4 queries in parallel (~1.5 s)
  par per posting (pool of 8)
    API->>A: Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby JSON (~0.2-2 s)
    A-->>API: open/closed + fields + questions
  and Workday
    API->>F: fetch ttl=0 (~9-34 s, flaky)
    API->>G: run-sse (60-200 s)
    G-->>UI: STREAMING_URL -> iframe
    G-->>API: PROGRESS ... COMPLETE(result per output_schema)
  end
  API->>L: fit + answers (3 concurrent, ~7 s)
  API-->>UI: SSE trace events + ranked cards
  UI->>API: prefill(job)
  API->>G: fill fields, never submit (guard cancels on "click submit")
  G-->>UI: live browser + filled-field report
